{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217400","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1321740001:1":{"text":"This letter says Amy lost the strength to walk... and even her voice...","source_cn":"这封信上写着，艾米没力气走路，甚至会失声……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AC4723523EF92C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321740002:1":{"text":"Were these the same symptoms Princess Yolena had?","source_cn":"这些也是亚莲娜公主生病时的症状吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03644A2B6A886576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321740003:1":{"text":"Yes, Regulus.","source_cn":"是的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4D73B6D5A627C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321740004:1":{"text":"By the time Miss Lydia arranged the celebration, Princess Yolena's health had already deteriorated greatly.","source_cn":"其实，莉娅女士筹备城堡庆典的时候，公主殿下的病已经很重了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73CF8CDD6A711031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321740005:1":{"text":"The Archduke and all who cared for her understood that her chances of recovery were slim. Yet, no one could bear to tell her the truth.","source_cn":"包括大公阁下在内，大家都知道公主殿下很可能再也好不起来...","status":"matched